<html lang="en">
<head>
    {% include '../components/global_head.njk' %}
    {% include '../components/google/organization.njk' %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/about.css">
</head>
    <body>
        {% include '../components/nav.njk' %}

        <div class='hero-with-content splash-small text-dark background-dark'>
            {# Hero banner #}
             <div class="content-full-column">
                <h1> Enterprise technology, delivered by the team who built it.</h1>
                <div class="container-two-columns">
                    <div>
                        <p>Tech in the cloud, team on the ground.</P>
                        <a href="{{url_get_started}}" target="_blank"><button class="button-warm-dark button-large">BOOK A DEMO</button></a>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <iframe class="video-hero-landing" width="560" height="315" src="{{url_video_embed}}" title="{{title_video_embed}}" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="approach-methodology skeleton block-half text-light background-light">
            {# Our Method #}
            <div class="content-full-column text-center">
                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                <h6>METHODOLOGY</h6>
                <h2>Our Tech➕Team approach</h2>
                <p>Our proprietary technology was built in-house over the last 8 years. It’s highly configurable and designed to scale as you grow. Our expert team knows this technology inside and out. Agile, fast, and efficient, we configure it so it fits your business like a glove.</p>
                <p>Bottom line: We don’t just give you software. We take full ownership of your success, ensuring a smooth and fast transformation.</p>
                <div class="container-four-columns">
                    <div class="container-flex-vertical-center">
                        <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/tick-clock.png" />
                        <strong>Fast to implement</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container-flex-vertical-center">
                        <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/tick-shield.png" />
                        <strong>Low-risk</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container-flex-vertical-center">
                        <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/light-bulb.png" />
                        <strong>Guided by experts</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container-flex-vertical-center">
                        <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/arrows.png" />
                        <strong>Flexible solutions</strong>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="approach-tech-team skeleton block-half text-dark background-dark">
            {# Tech + Team #}
            <div class='content-narrow-column'>
                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                <div class='container-quarter-main'>
                        <div class="container-vertical-center">
                            <img src='/src/assets/images/approach/tech-plus.png' />
                        </div>
                        <div class="container-vertical-center">
                            <p>Rapid technology built on Microsoft Azure. It's fast to configure, modular and built to adapt as your business grows. Because we maintain it in-house, you don't have to worry about maintenance and upgrades — it's all taken care of.</p>
                        </div>
                </div>
                <div class="spacer-small"></div>
                <div class='container-main-quarter'>
                    <div class="container-vertical-center">
                        <p>We're with you every step of the way. Our consultants and developers become an extension of your team - guiding the process, solving problems and making sure your tech works seamlessly from day one.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container-vertical-center">
                        <img src='/src/assets/images/approach/plus-team.png' />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="approach-justification skeleton block-half text-light background-light">
            {# Justification #}
            <div class="content-full-column">
                <div class="container-two-columns">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Tech transformation doesn't have to be risky.</h3>
                        <p>We've seen the blowouts and breakdowns - so we built a better way.</p>
                        <p>With 8 years behind our own platform, we deliver industry-ready solutions that evolve with you. Our iterative, low-risk approach means progress you can trust - one smart step at a time. </p>
                        <p>No chaos. No curveballs. Just steady, smooth transformation.</p>
                        <a href="{{url_get_started}}" target="_blank"><button class="button-cool-light button-large">BOOK A DEMO</button></a>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/team-laughing.png" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="approach-blueprint skeleton block-half text-dark background-dark">
            {# Blueprint cards #}
            <div class="spacer-small"></div>
            <div class="content-full-column">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <h3>Your blueprint for <span class="text-highlight-cool-dark">digital excellence<span></h3>
                </div>
                <div class="container-two-columns">
                    <div class="container-flex-vertical-center card-padded">
                        <img class="card-large-icon" src="/src/assets/images/approach/tech-abstract.png" />
                        <h3>Future-focused SaaS platform</h3>
                        <p>A cloud-native solution built on Microsoft Azure. Rapid Platform leverages cutting-edge cloud integration capabilities, helping organisations accelerate innovation, scale seamlessly, and adapt to new challenges in real time.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container-flex-vertical-center card-padded">
                        <img class="card-large-icon" src="/src/assets/images/approach/tech-chip.png" />
                        <h3>AI accelerating efficiency</h3>
                        <p>Harness the power of artificial intelligence to drive efficiency. Rapid Platform is designed with built-in AI, reducing time-on-task by up to 30% for key workflows—empowering your team to accomplish more, faster.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="container-two-columns">
                    <div class="container-flex-vertical-center card-padded">
                        <img class="card-large-icon" src="/src/assets/images/approach/tech-orb.png" />
                        <h3>Teams and projects connected seamlessly</h3>
                        <p>Stay aligned with a flexible, adaptable data model that ensures all your processes are integrated into one central hub. Rapid Platform guarantees you always have a single source of truth, enabling quick, informed decision-making.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container-flex-vertical-center card-padded">
                        <img class="card-large-icon" src="/src/assets/images/approach/tech-arrows.png" />
                        <h3>Empowering your team with automation</h3>
                        <p>Free your people from repetitive tasks with Rapid Platform’s smart automation. Our platform simplifies complex processes, reducing manual effort so your teams can focus on what matters most. With low-code tools, you have full control to adapt and customise the experience to your unique business needs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="center-content content-narrow-column text-center">
                <h4 class="text-highlight-cool-dark">Integrated with the Best of Microsoft</h4>
                </br>
                <div class="approach-container-logos">
                    <span class="text-highlight-cool-light">&lt;</span>
                    <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/ms-office-365.svg" />
                    <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/ms-outlook.svg" />
                    <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/ms-power-automate.svg" />
                    <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/ms-power-bi.svg" />
                    <span class="text-highlight-cool-light">&gt;</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="spacer-small"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="approach-team skeleton block-half text-light background-light">
            {# Meet the Team *TF2 Music* #}
            <div class="content-narrow-column text-center">
                <h3>Meet the team</h3>
                <p>Our consultants deliver tech solutions that shift your business forward</p>
                <div class="card-grid">
                    {% for item in team%}
                    <div class="card-vertical">
                        <img src="{{item.image_url}}" />
                        <p>{{item.name}} - {{item.position}}</p>
                        </br>
                    </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="approach-CTA skeleton block-half text-dark background-dark">
            {% include '../components/cta/book_demo.njk'%}
        </div>

        <div class="approach-promise skeleton block-half text-light background-light">
            {# Our Promise #}
            <div class="spacer-small"></div>
            <div class="content-narrow-column">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <h6>OUR PROMISE</h6>
                    <h3>From idea to implementation, we're with you every step of the way.</h3>
                    </br>
                </div>
                <div class="container-two-columns">
                    <div class="container-vertical-center">
                        <p>"We don't just provide tech solutions - we partner with you to understand your unique challenges, create tailored solutions, and ensure seamless execution.</p>
                        <p>Our goal is to see your vision come to life, unlocking the power of technology so your business can thrive as it grows and changes."</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <img src="/src/assets/images/approach/mitch.png"/>
                        <p>Mitch Hunt - CEO &amp; Cofounder of Rapid Platform</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="spacer-small"></div>
        </div>
        
        {% include '../components/footer.njk' %}
    </body>
</html>
